---
const columns = [
	{
		title: 'You think differently',
		body: "Whether you've just been diagnosed or have felt different most of your life, the world can feel like it wasn't built for you. Together we find what helps and what doesn't, so you spend less energy getting through the day and more on the life you want.",
	},
	{
		title: 'Life is heavy right now',
		body: "Grief, loss, trauma, or just too much at once. I'll give you a space to slow down and breathe, so you can find your feet again.",
	},
	{
		title: "You're stuck",
		body: "Sometimes a hard moment, or someone's honesty, wakes you up to it. You might have spent a long time on autopilot, stressed or stuck. This is a safe space to work out what to change, at your own pace.",
	},
];
---

<section class="why-youre-here">
	<div class="wrap">
		<h2>You might be here because</h2>
		<div class="why-grid">
			{
				columns.map((column) => (
					<div class="why-column">
						<h3>{column.title}</h3>
						<p>{column.body}</p>
					</div>
				))
			}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.why-youre-here {
		padding: var(--space-20) 0;
		background: var(--color-bg-card);
		border-top: var(--border-hairline) solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.why-youre-here h2 {
		font-size: var(--fs-display);
		line-height: var(--lh-article-title);
		font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
		margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
	}

	.why-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: var(--space-8);
	}

	.why-column h3 {
		font-size: var(--fs-card-title);
		font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
		color: var(--color-text-primary);
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
	}

	.why-column p {
		font-size: var(--fs-prose-body);
		color: var(--color-text-secondary);
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 820px) {
		.why-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: var(--space-8);
		}
	}
</style>
